    "The failure teardown hierarchy is truncated at24000characters; the separate38375-byte full hierarchy supplies decisive structure.",
    "Nine required Default captures exist; three Default and all12AXXXL captures were not reached. The two failure screenshots are diagnostic and do not fill required slots.",
